 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lots of fun activities. Stickers are great for little ones, and you and your parent can do the puzzle together. And you can read together too, from where you left off at the store. Then stick to one thing you all like, and keep it simple. Then ask her to leave the room before you put it on, so it doesn't scare her. And offer it with something nice, like couscous and peppermint tea. Popcorn, which everyone loves, but keep an eye on the time. Stickers, photo album, and one dish you all enjoy together. Your parent and you can read from the photo album, your grandpa can eat salt, and the kid can have popcorn.",
